Rampsmith

Link a store to your agency
===========================

The owner of Example Outfitters shared a one-time code so that your agency
can work on the store in Rampsmith.

Store-link code

    TEST-K7QX-M2PL

Sign in to your Rampsmith dashboard, choose Link a store, and enter the
code.

Open the dashboard:
https://app.rampsmith.example/agency/link-store

The code works once and expires on October 18, 2026 at 10:00 AM UTC.

Linking gives your agency access to this one store only. The store owner can
remove that access at any time.

If you did not expect this code, ignore this email. Nothing happens unless
someone enters it.

____________________________________________________________________________

You received this email because the owner of Example Outfitters asked
Rampsmith to send this code to this address.

Questions? Write to support@rampsmith.example.
